  "body": "```\r\n./delta/35/stream_order_to_extrem.sql:CREATE TABLE stream_ordering_to_exterm (\r\n./delta/35/stream_order_to_extrem.sql:INSERT INTO stream_ordering_to_exterm (stream_ordering, room_id, event_id)\r\n./delta/35/stream_order_to_extrem.sql:CREATE INDEX stream_ordering_to_exterm_idx on stream_ordering_to_exterm(\r\n./delta/35/stream_order_to_extrem.sql:CREATE INDEX stream_ordering_to_exterm_rm_idx on stream_ordering_to_exterm(\r\n```\r\n\r\ncompare the filename to the table & index names.  Please can we rename them - it's incredibly painful to have to remember other peoples' typos.  (I'd also have thought 'leaf' would have been a better term than 'extremity', but I guess that ship has sailed)",
